' UC-IAL-01 — Create User Account

@startuml
skinparam conditionStyle inside
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFEAA7
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #DFE6E9
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #2D3436

|WAH Central Administrator|
start
:1.0 Access centralized account creation function;

|WAHrden System|
:1.1 Verify administrator authority;
if (Authorized?) then (No [EF-01])
  :Present access-denied result;
  kill
else (Yes)
  :1.2 Present account-creation form & requirements;
endif

|WAH Central Administrator|
:2.0 Enter required account information;
:2.1 Submit account information;

|WAHrden System|
:2.2 Validate submitted information;
if (Information valid & complete?) then (No [EF-02])
  :Identify validation issues & prompt for correction;
  kill
else (Yes)
  :2.3 Check for existing/conflicting centralized identity;
  if (Duplicate/Conflict exists?) then (Yes [EF-03])
    :Prevent creation & present conflict for review;
    kill
  else (No)
    :3.0 Present validated information for review;
  endif
endif

|WAH Central Administrator|
if (Confirm creation?) then (No / Cancel [EF-04])
  :Cancel account creation;
  kill
else (Yes [3.1])
  :Confirm creation;
endif

|WAHrden System|
:4.0 Attempt to create account & set initial state;
if (Creation succeeds?) then (No [EF-05])
  :Present account-creation failure result;
  kill
else (Yes)
  |Database / Audit|
  :4.1 Record account creation & audit trail;
  
  |WAHrden System|
  :4.2 Present resulting centralized account & success result;
endif

|WAH Central Administrator|
:Receive creation confirmation;
stop
@enduml
